source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira opens the span at the first `}}` and silently consumes the trailing backslash; jiro keeps the backslash in the code body.
-- input.jira --
{{a\}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a\`
